        "headline": "Foundational oral support",
        "supporting": "Therapeutic Oral Spray",
        "intro": "<p><strong>A core component of MARCEL OMR Therapy Foundation Kit for Stage 1 &amp; Stage 2 OSMF.</strong></p><p>MARCEL Ora-Care is a metered oral spray that gives a measured amount with every spray. It is the foundational format in MARCEL OMR Therapy Foundation Kit and is meant to be part of your regular oral care routine, with guidance from a qualified healthcare professional.</p>",
